                "title": "Avalon Single Cylinder Handleset, Kwikset 800AVH",
                "description": "This stylish handleset features edged rectangle mounts. The deadbolt is operated by key outside, thumbturn inside; while the latchbolt underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob inside and a thumbpiece outside. Ashfield Single Cylinder Handle Set is made by Kwikset and is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty. Solid brass construction ensures it could last for many years to come. Good for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
